# Shipping (protected `master`)

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the full runbook.

- Never `git push origin master`. Use a PR; merge when **CI** (`quality`) is green.
- Releases: merge version/changelog to `master`, then `git tag vX.Y.Z` and `git push origin vX.Y.Z` only.
- Merges to `master` auto-deploy landing/Firebase (path filters). Tags trigger **Build releases**.
